      "violationName": "Missing Summary for Details Element",
      "category": "semantic",
      "html": "<details><summary></summary><p>This is a website. We are available 24/7.</p></details>",
      "target": null,
      "description": "The <details> element has no summary text, which can be crucial for users with screen readers or other assistive technologies to understand the content of the details.",
      "impact": "serious",
      "confidence": 1.0
    }
  ]
}

